Dear community,

I am conducting a CFA with categorical variables and I have three questions:

Would you recommend using the ULS or the ULSMV estimator?

Regarding model fit indices, is it advisable to examine the same indices as when using WLSMV (CFI, TLI, RMSEA, SRMR)?
2.1. Would the acceptable cutoff values for these indices be the same?

Would these recommendations change depending on the sample size? I am working with two samples, one with approximately 220 cases and another with 1,810 cases.

Thank you very much in advance.
Best regards,

