Hi, I am recently running a one-factor MG-CFA using categorical data:

model<-"

X=~x1+x2+x3+x4+x5

"

fit1<-sem(model,data=data,
ordered = c("x1","x2","x3","x4","x5"),
parameterization="delta",
meanstructure = TRUE,
group = "sex")

fit2<-sem(model,data=data,
ordered = c("x1","x2","x3","x4","x5"),
parameterization="theta",
meanstructure = TRUE,
group = "sex")

